[{"client_msg_id":"5aabac14-7620-4dbd-955e-dfe0cef88dae","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"自分でフィルタ書けた筈なのでユニークするとか。","ts":"1619954204.318400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9FmD5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75DCE75A-8412-4EE8-AE64-99C3632C3FA5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"asyncompleteのsource混ぜるとよろしくない感じになりますよね。。補完sourceなので混ぜて使う想定なものではあるのですが。","ts":"1619931509.318300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1iyu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f61912df-e91e-4702-8da6-c4c3763b69b6","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"これ自分も全く同じでした。\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/slacklog/CJMV3MSLR/2021/02/#ts-1612591390.340400\u003e\nを教えていただいたんですが、結局乗り換え失敗しました。","ts":"1619927788.314600","thread_ts":"1619920751.305700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HEKzX"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"6bf4cd7c-b506-4899-8045-4a118380db0f","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"prabirshrestha/vim-lsp・prabirshrestha/asyncomplete.vim・yami-beta/asyncomplete-omni.vim を利用していて、補完が発動するときに最初の候補がバッファに入ってしまって困っている。同じ現象が起きている方はいらっしゃいますか。","ts":"1619920751.305700","thread_ts":"1619920751.305700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MUV+D"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"82af1e6d-206a-4e57-a1a0-8d87c3d580e5","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"g:asyncomplete_auto_completeoptに任せずに、最初からcompleteoptを調整してやれば直った、かも。","ts":"1619926040.314500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xxlL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a64d965a-f5f3-4832-ae67-f1f5ce4d6c85","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"非同期は難しいんですよ","ts":"1619925530.313900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LDCT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ce1cc58-52c6-4a72-8870-d993c8586728","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"プラグインの実装側でちゃんと対処しないと起こります","ts":"1619925177.313800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r2Re"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f41b547-483e-4b9f-a4f2-0112229e965c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"completeoptオプションの変更がうまくいってないときに起こる現象ですね","ts":"1619925160.313700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ahf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60486cb6-82c3-4dda-85c8-1ae8b78747d1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ふむ、それは非同期補完の時に","ts":"1619925137.313600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qmu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1775cc08-fdcd-4535-b4e3-4047d2c73867","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ということは、\n```g:asyncomplete_auto_completeopt               *g:asyncomplete_auto_completeopt*\n\n    Type: |Number|\n    Default: 1\n\n    Set default `completeopt` options. These are `menuone,noinsert,noselect`.\n    This effectively overwrites what ever the user has in their config file.\n\n    Set to 0 to disable.```\nで `menuone,noinsert,noselect` になりつつ、補完が動いてinsertされないはず...だけどなあ","ts":"1619923344.313500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VBjj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7528e04c-35ba-4fa7-bd0a-9585ed9b6196","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"設定してなくてデフォルトの値になっています","ts":"1619923225.312600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1AXN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95aa4595-a084-484a-ab8e-52c09f0ab1ad","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"g:asyncomplete_auto_completeopt の設定はどうしてます?","ts":"1619923186.312200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3RSBg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab59d941-4fff-4b41-8787-2ea6658d26cf","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"`set completeopt=menu` desu","ts":"1619923125.311800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Qie"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbefc6f6-b338-4598-81e8-bbc87e55c6c1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"今回だと、omniが処理される仮定で、completeoptの設定値的にバッファに入る挙動になっちゃってる?","ts":"1619923089.311200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ocab"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0f50f85-2cf8-4098-8a3e-d9097955beb1","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"できるだけlspに寄せてomniの方はallowlistで必要な場面のみというのが良さそうか…","ts":"1619923055.310500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4es"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e3d3c1a-84d5-4a5f-8e13-dbdbb44a2f2a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いや、自分のときは\n• vim-lsp -\u0026gt; asyncomplete-lsp -\u0026gt; asyncompleteで出る補完候補\n• vim-lsp(のomni用関数) -\u0026gt; asyncomplete-omni -\u0026gt; asyncomplete で出る補完候補\nの都合でなんか変になったような","ts":"1619923041.310000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nrq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"799f0f69-7559-4b77-b4f4-4777985431f5","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"気をつけポイントってどこかに書かれていたりします？確かに衝突しているのかもしれない…","ts":"1619922865.308300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hCObg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"470ba309-6d61-41e9-96d6-f45adb5a0370","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"asyncomplete-lsp経由じゃなくて、omni関数をasyncomplete-omniで呼ぶ動かしかたしてたりします?","ts":"1619921416.307600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FEWs1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6eca3ab3-d1f1-4aa3-822b-889276659635","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分のなってない、はasyncomplete-omniを使ってないこともあるので参考にもなりませんが...","ts":"1619921265.306900","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1619921283.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7TL+p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce7f42df-2f39-483d-bce3-4f2342dfa93b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶんなってないですが、vim-lspとasyncomplete-omniは気をつけないと事故りますが、設定だいじょうぶですか?","ts":"1619921220.306400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wDeh0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bf4cd7c-b506-4899-8045-4a118380db0f","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"prabirshrestha/vim-lsp・prabirshrestha/asyncomplete.vim・yami-beta/asyncomplete-omni.vim を利用していて、補完が発動するときに最初の候補がバッファに入ってしまって困っている。同じ現象が起きている方はいらっしゃいますか。","ts":"1619920751.305700","thread_ts":"1619920751.305700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MUV+D"}]}]
